research team. So we call that Wizard of Oz in robotic terms. And the reason why we do that is, I think oftentimes soldiers are given a lot of equipment, and it takes a long time for them to learn how to use it. And sometimes they don't have the interest or time to learn. So right now we're just saying, hey, you know, the robot team is going to, you know, us researchers, we're going to control it. And these are the things it can and cannot do. And these are the things we would like you not to do to it, right? Because there's some research out there that people abuse a robot. So they'll kick it over or they'll do things like that.

