control. And I said, you know what, I'm going to give this a try. I was just so curious about it. And I arrived here. And two things, the students, phenomenal young men and women. I mean, you tell them the bar is here and they will jump much higher. The types of research I'm able to do with them is just incredible because they're just so bright and curious and interested. And I think part of that is me being able to.

